## 3. Entity Overview

```txt
users ──< workspace_members >── workspaces
                                   │
       invitations >──────────────┤
       refresh_tokens >── users    │
       oauth_states  >── users     │
                                   ├──< source_connections ──< source_channels
                                   │            │
                                   │            └──< webhook_subscriptions
                                   ├──< decisions ──< decision_pins
                                   ├──< reviews
                                   ├──< skills ──< skill_versions
                                   ├──< brain_builds
                                   ├──< brain_conversations ──< brain_messages
                                   ├──< api_keys
                                   ├──< usage_periods
                                   ├──< activity_events
                                   └──< audit_log

companies   (standalone marketing waitlist — NOT tenant-scoped)
```

Tenant-scoped tables (carry `workspace_id`, RLS-protected): `workspace_members`,
`invitations`, `source_connections`, `source_channels`, `webhook_subscriptions`,
`decisions`, `decision_pins`, `reviews`, `skills`, `skill_versions`, `brain_builds`,
`brain_conversations`, `brain_messages`, `api_keys`, `usage_periods`,
`activity_events`, `audit_log`.

Global tables (no tenant column): `users`, `workspaces`, `refresh_tokens`,
`oauth_states`, `companies`.

