## Appendix A — AI Service Schema (reference, not backend-owned)

The SQL below is the **AI service's** PostgreSQL schema (Supabase: `vector` +
`pgcrypto`, UUID keys, `organizations` tenant, RLS via `request.jwt.claims`). It is
reproduced here verbatim as the **integration reference** the backend talks to over
HTTP — the backend does **not** own or migrate these tables. Use it together with the
mapping in §13 when wiring the AI-service client.

```sql
